Configuration, dotfiles, and scripts of Sushant's workstation
=============================================================

Replicate Sushant's workstation configuration.

Environment
-----------

Operating systems which were used to run this repository successfully:

+----------------------------------------------------------+
| NAME          | VERSION                         | ARCH   |
|---------------|---------------------------------|--------|
| Fedora Linux  | 44 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) | x86_64 |
+----------------------------------------------------------+

Notes:
* `cat /etc/os-release` @ {NAME,VERSION}.
* `lscpu` @ {ARCH}.
* Arrange all the rows in alphabetical order @ {NAME}.
* Running this on any other OS than the above listed ones, and then reporting back to me with the
  results to expand the above table would be very appreciated.

Install
-------

```bash
mkdir -p /tmp/sushant
cd /tmp/sushant
git clone https://github.com/mondalsushant/workstation.git mondalsushant-workstation
cd mondalsushant-workstation/src/scripts
chmod +x main.sh
./main.sh
```

Uninstall
---------

```bash
rm -rf /tmp/sushant
```

